    m_Localized: (placeholder) A black door. Basement. Of course there's a basement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 117319819984896
    m_Localized: (placeholder) Three switches. Light them all up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 117319899676672
    m_Localized: (placeholder) They lit up in an order. Maybe that order matters.
    m_Metadata:
